{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And five of you shall pursue</b> — in gematria: חלשים שבכם (the weak among you)." "<b>רבבה</b> — four times in the Masorah: אחותנו את היי לאלפי רבבה · רבבה כצמח השדה · ושנים יניסו רבבה · רבבה ירדופו. For they prayed over her that her seed would be from those of whom it is said רבבה כצמח and רבבה ירדופו."], :book :leviticus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:20:43.153381235Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}